  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The coordinated charges of you and your allies leave your foes especially vulnerable.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Cavalry Formation<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When charging while mounted, you and your mount can overlap the space of other mounted creatures as normal for this feat even if their riders do not have this feat. In addition, when you make a charge attack against a creature that has been the target of a charge attack by another creature with this feat since the end of your last turn, add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to your attack and damage roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
